  TEST_ASSERTIONS: [RM-C03, RM-C04]
  INVARIANTS: [EK-TIME, EK-TIMING-INTERPRETATION, LIFE-TIME, EXT-TIME-NULL, BO-TIME, OWD-TIME-PROVENANCE]
  FORBIDDEN:
    - Subtracting or ordering monotonic coordinates across clocks, origins, or boots.
    - Using UTC annotations to reconstruct elapsed time or restart downtime.
    - Replacing missing duration with zero or changing an exact subject-reported zero.
    - Treating local waiting duration as native execution duration or dividing aggregate runtime into step timings.
  VERIFICATION: cargo test -p rm_time -- rm-c03 rm-c04

